## 2. Agent Roster: The 3 Real Agentic Pillars vs. Non-AI Components

[Certain] Not everything in this platform is an LLM. Using non-AI algorithms where math is superior is a feature, not a gap.

### The 3 Real Agentic Components (Pitch Core):
1. **Agent 1: Voice/NLP Prescription Parsing Agent (`agents/graphs/prescription_parser.py`)**
   - *Engine:* Groq LLM (`llama-3.3-70b-versatile`)
   - *Role:* Transforms unstructured speech/text streams into a validated 3-section Header-Body-Tail JSON (`medications`, `dietary_advice`, `recorded_diagnosis`, `follow_up_date`).
2. **Agent 2: Specialty Suggestion Agent (`agents/graphs/specialty_suggestion.py`)**
   - *Engine:* Groq LLM (`llama-3.3-70b-versatile` / `llama-3.1-8b-instant`)
   - *Role:* Maps free-text patient symptom descriptions (e.g., *"severe chest pain and left arm numbness"*) to verified hospital specialty tags (`Cardiology`, `Trauma`) **without diagnosing disease**.
3. **Agent 3: Hospital Ranking Agent (`agents/graphs/hospital_ranking.py`)**
   - *Engine:* Groq LLM (`llama-3.3-70b-versatile`)
   - *Role:* Evaluates candidate hospital metadata against user GPS coordinates, 24/7 ER status, bed counts, and priority weights to produce a 1-line reasoned shortlist.

### Supporting / Auxiliary Agents & Non-AI Engines:
- **Handwritten Slip Vision OCR Agent (`ocr_engine/main.py`):** Gemini 2.0 Flash Vision (Multimodal CV fallback).
- **Patient Greeting & Context Agent (`agents/graphs/context_agent.py`):** Structured DB check-in agent.
- **Drug-Info Chatbot (`agents/graphs/drug_info_rag.py`):** OpenFDA RAG retriever (Stretch).
- **Geospatial Distance Calculator (`backend-and-mapping/src/services/geoDistance.js`):** **Pure Haversine Math (Explicitly NOT AI)**.

